    cat("\n  Key insight: The truncated proposal (reject b[k] < 0) ensures EVERY\n")
    cat("  posterior draw has non-negative population effects, so the expected\n")
    cat("  forecast (mu) is guaranteed monotone across growth scenarios.\n")
    cat("  Minor violations in y_pred come only from the random AR noise term.\n")
    
} else {
